    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION Converts protoheme IX and farnesyl diphosphate to heme O.CATALYTIC ACTIVITY heme b + (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate + H2O = Fe(II)-heme o + diphosphateSUBCELLULAR LOCATION The disease is caused by variants affecting the gene represented in this entry.SIMILARITY Belongs to the UbiA prenyltransferase family.</bp:comment>
  </bp:ProteinReference>
